# CS412 Android App
## Assignment 3 Additions
- Added 'MyForegroundService' : Service that gives a notification when started and supports binding to retrieve grade
- Added 'MyBroadcastReciever' : registered in 'MainActivity.onStart()' and unregistered in 'onStop()' Listens for custom action 'com.example.MY_ACTION' and shows toast notification
- MainActivity has 3 new buttons: Start Service, Bind Service, and Send Broadcast

## Testing Environment
- Pixel 8
- Android 17.0

## How to Run
1. Open the project in Android Studio.
2. Build and run on the emulator/device listed above.
3. Tap either button on the main screen to navigate to the second activity.
4. Tap "Main Activity" to return.
5. Tap "Start Service" to start the foreground service. A notification will appear in the notification section
6. Tap "Bind Service" to bind the service; the grade will be returned to the right of the button
7. Tap "Send Broadcast" to send a custom broadcast; A toast message will show on the bottom of the screen